  "len": 16,
  "en": "Touya: Oh, r-right...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1552,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce398:00621",
  "jp": "フェイン「ふふふふ‥‥このフェイン・ジン・バリオンに{nl}　隠し事をしようとなど‥‥あれ？　トウヤ？　おーい‥‥」",
  "off": 1569,
  "len": 69,
  "en": "Fain: Fufufufu... To think you'd try to hide something from me, Fain Jin Barion... Huh? Touya? Hellooo...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1571,
  "text_len": 66
 },
 {
  "id": "sce398:00673",
  "jp": "フェイン「ははぁ～ん、やっぱり‥‥」",
